lychee (0.24.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release, from 0.15.1: upstream moved to workspace-prefixed
    release tags (lychee-v*), so package.conf now tracks that scheme
  * Build-Depends: cmake for aws-lc-sys; drop libssl-dev, upstream moved
    from OpenSSL to rustls and openssl-sys is no longer in the lock file
  * Depends: ca-certificates. rustls loads the trust store at client
    construction and aborts when it is empty, so on a system without it
    lychee fails before doing any work, --offline included

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:14:59 +0200
